WEBVTT

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:48.040
For our performance at the Ayanagi Festival,
we started practicing even more seriously.

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:51.290
It's almost time for us
to perform for an audience

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:54.910
the best performance that we,
Team Otori, can prepare!

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:59.160
You're still off, you boor.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:00.250
Sorry...

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:04.660
You're early on a few spots yourself, Tengenji.

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.750
Shall we try it again from the top?

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:11.330
Yeah, let's keep doing it until
we're together for the whole thing.

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:18.250
Working hard, huh, boys?

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:19.790
Otori, sir!

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:22.580
Let's take a break.

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:33.330
<i>D-R-E-A-M-E-R, Dreamer</i>

00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:40.700
<i>Clicking my heels on the pavement after the rain</i>

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:47.830
<i>With light steps,</i>
<i>in high spirits, my heart leaps</i>

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:55.660
<i>"Purely, delightfully, humorously"</i>

00:01:55.660 --> 00:01:57.160
<i>Wow oh Wow oh</i>

00:01:57.160 --> 00:02:03.700
<i>That's my motto</i>

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:11.950
<i>If I'm going to move forward without</i>
<i>doing anything and break into pieces</i>

00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:18.250
<i>Then I'll go for broke, I won't look back</i>

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:19.290
<i>Go! Go!</i>

00:02:19.290 --> 00:02:26.750
<i>If I just keep looking at it,</i>
<i>my dream will remain a dream</i>

00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:30.450
<i>I don't want to give up,</i>
<i>don't want to have regrets</i>

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:36.200
<i>I don't know how, but it's not impossible</i>

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:40.790
<i>I'm a Dreamer.</i>

00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:41.870
<i>I'm a Dreamer.</i>
"STARMYU"

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:45.410
<i>D-R-E-A-M-E-R, Dreamer</i>
"STARMYU"

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:52.910
<i>D-R-E-A-M-E-R, Dreamer</i>

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:56.200
"Orange" "Act 9"
Thanks for the drinks!

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:59.000
"Act 9"

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:03.160
"This is a work of fiction and is not related
to any existing persons, groups, or names."

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.250
I feel alive again!

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:05.950
Oh, sweet nectar!

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:07.080
Put empty cans here.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.160
Right.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.410
Otori, sir, thanks for the drinks!

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:14.830
You know, boys...

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:18.330
I understand that you're thirsty, but you
should read the instructions before you drink.

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:21.410
"Please shake well before drinking"...?

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:26.750
I know!

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:37.120
He's forcing it.

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:05.160
Sorry, sorry. You guys really
are the best at making me laugh.

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:07.750
Or the best at being foolish?

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:09.250
Calling us foolish is mean.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:11.250
But best sounds good, doesn't it?

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:12.700
Yeah.

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:30.000
Otori, sir?

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.870
What are you doing...?

00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:40.790
I am a fool, as well...

00:04:40.790 --> 00:04:42.750
...the best fool.

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:46.410
You boys are fine the way you are.

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:49.790
Do your best. Make sure you don't lose, boys!

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:51.200
Y-Yes, sir!

00:04:55.410 --> 00:04:56.750
Otori, sir?

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:11.000
The Kao Council has made a
decision after careful deliberation.

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:17.540
We hereby cancel the performance of the
Star Team, Team Otori, at the Ayanagi Festival.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:23.830
There is no room for discussion.
This matter has been decided.

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:35.160
What are you thinking about?

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:38.580
Whatever you do, please do not run away.

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:40.950
Like you did back then.

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:43.290
Are you telling me to abandon the five of them?

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:49.620
As long as you remain on the Kao Council,
your efforts with them will not be wasted.

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:53.450
Giving up is something a fool would do.

00:05:56.830 --> 00:06:00.080
I am a fool...

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:01.750
...the best fool.

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:16.370
Were we destined for this fate,
ever since that day...?

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:25.620
Can you do it, Tsubasa?

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:26.950
Easy!

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.040
What do you think, Itsuki?

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:36.000
I knew you could do it, Tsubasa!

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:41.160
Why don't we try it together next?

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:42.330
Okay!

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:52.000
Grandpa Hiragi?

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:55.450
The head family?

00:06:55.450 --> 00:07:00.160
That's right. You will become
a child of the Hiragi head family.

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:02.330
Of the Hiragi family...?

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.080
Tsubasa!

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:24.910
Let's play together again!

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:27.370
It's a promise!

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:27.370
Face forward.

00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:31.500
You are no longer Tsubasa Otori.

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:34.160
You are now Tsubasa Hiragi.

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:39.790
It's a promise, okay? Tsubasa!

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:55.950
One more time.

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:06.450
Of course you made it, Tsubasa Hiragi.

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:14.080
It's been a long time, Tsubasa.

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:17.410
Have you been well since then?

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:19.200
Y-Yeah...

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:24.370
It's been a while, um... Otori.

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:26.700
Otori?

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:29.080
The head family has its reasons, huh?

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:31.580
You must have it hard, Tsubasa.

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:35.040
Don't call me Tsubasa, either.

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:39.290
All right, Tsuba... Hiragi.

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:40.290
Sorry.

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:44.200
More importantly, look. We're on the same team.

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:48.290
"(Team Tsukigami): Tsubasa Hiragi, Itsuki Otori,
Kyoji Akatsuki, Lion C. Yuzuriha, Sakuya Sazanami"

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:51.830
You're on Team Tsukigami, too, Otori?

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:55.620
Yeah. By the way, who is this Tsukigami, anyway?

00:09:55.620 --> 00:09:58.160
You don't know who Haruto Tsukigami is?

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:04.790
He's a genius who auditioned for and got a part
in a Broadway musical while still in high school.

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:08.000
He's an amazing person, huh?

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:12.370
I'm more happy that I can play with you again.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:14.830
Tsubasa!

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:18.580
Let's play together again!

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:26.410
Otori, you haven't changed at all, have you?

00:10:26.410 --> 00:10:28.120
Not since that time.

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:31.120
You haven't changed either.

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:47.660
I'm Haruto Tsukigami, and I'm here to teach you.

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:52.290
I guarantee that all five of you are
talented students from the school's elite.

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:55.160
I want you to aim for the
musical department with confidence.

00:10:55.160 --> 00:10:56.620
Yes, sir!

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:03.120
What's wrong?

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:06.870
You have to get through the
Newcomers' Debut Performance first.

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:09.370
You can't be wanting to give up with just this.

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:10.700
Yes, sir!

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:15.540
Tsukigami, sir, can we add our own
arrangement to "Ayanagi Showtime"?

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:18.700
What are you saying, Otori?

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:23.200
We should do the assigned piece
with the judges' evaluations in mind!

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:26.660
<i>Oui</i> , it's true that it
would not be good to risk it.

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:30.410
There is no need to discuss this.

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:36.000
I also agree with Akatsuki and the others...

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:40.500
Do you object?

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:45.250
I'm not so selfish that I will disrupt the
team to make things go my way. It's just...

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:48.330
Just?

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:55.200
I want to dance more freely
to express how I feel.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:56.830
Freely...

00:11:56.830 --> 00:11:59.620
Don't you feel that way, Hiragi?

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:02.370
I would be lying if I said I didn't,

00:12:02.370 --> 00:12:07.500
but we're students, so we should
be learning the basics right now...

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:09.870
Freedom can come later...

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:12.250
I see...

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:23.370
All right!

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:26.910
I'm so glad!

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:37.700
"Musical Department Entrance Exam - Round 2" "Newcomers'
Debut Performance Evaluation Results" "1. Team Tsukigami"

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:46.750
What's wrong?

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:56.790
I wonder what meaning there is in this...

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:59.120
Are you sure you want to leave the Star Team?

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:03.450
Yes... I'd like to be a little more free...

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:05.250
That's just like you, Otori.

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:09.660
I think it's unfortunate,
but I understand what you're trying to say.

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:15.160
Thank you for your care in this short time.

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:19.830
You're fine the way you are, Otori.

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:22.790
Do your best. Make sure you don't lose!

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:25.330
Yes, sir!

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:36.790
Otori! What do you mean, you're quitting?

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:40.500
You heard it all, didn't you?

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.580
What are you saying?

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:45.700
Isn't this only the beginning for us...?

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:48.120
Of course, I'll aim for the musical department.

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:50.750
Then why? Why talk about freedom now?

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:53.540
I can't play with the Ayanagi rules.

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:56.120
Since we're brothers, you must also actually--

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:59.830
Stop it! Don't act like a
big brother at a time like this!

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:07.200
You made me remember our bond as brothers
and our hope to move forward together.

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:09.910
But now, you're...

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:12.040
How can you be so selfish?

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:17.330
My feelings have never changed.
Together with you, I want to--

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:19.410
Don't say any more than that!

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:22.200
I am a member of the Hiragi family!

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:25.500
I will be the top of the class at
Ayanagi Academy, join the Kao Council,

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.830
and one day be in a
position to protect the school!

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:30.410
I cannot allow selfishness like yours!

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:32.120
That's why...

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:35.700
I can't be you, Hiragi. Sorry.

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:50.290
Are you going to leave me alone again...?

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:57.870
Again...

00:15:17.290 --> 00:15:21.120
Have you told them their performance
at Ayanagi Festival is cancelled yet?

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:25.830
Do you remember, Hiragi?

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:30.040
When we were still Team Tsukigami...

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:34.540
You're off again.

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:36.700
Whoops! Again?

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:37.620
Sorry.

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:39.580
Maybe your breathing's off, Akatsuki?

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:42.950
Let's try breathing together before the step.

00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:44.250
Breathing?

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:46.120
That's important, huh?

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:48.750
You were doing it right, but you didn't notice?

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:50.290
Yeah...

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:52.120
So serious...

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:55.500
Everyone, let's take a break!
I have something to tell you.

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:57.330
Yes, sir!

00:15:57.620 --> 00:16:01.950
Tsukigami always brought us orange juice.

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:05.750
He said it was because
citric acid was good for recovery...

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:08.500
But after we drank that juice...

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:10.790
There was always a lecture...

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:12.910
He was probably using it
to hide his embarrassment

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:15.040
when he had to say something
that was hard to say.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:18.120
I finally understand how he felt.

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:21.250
You're not one to talk about the past.

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.910
I just suddenly remembered...

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:26.080
That tangy sweetness...

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:31.450
Thanks to him,
I still don't really like orange juice.

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:35.450
Hiragi.

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:40.410
Are you going to say more than that?

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:52.290
Thank you for protecting me until now.

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:54.620
If you knew, then why?!

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:57.250
Do you know how I've felt all this time...?

00:16:57.250 --> 00:16:59.620
You're too serious.

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:02.790
I never asked you to do that.

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:06.910
We are responsible for shouldering
the future of Ayanagi Academy!

00:17:06.910 --> 00:17:11.950
Even if it means stealing the
underclassmen's dreams for the sake of Ayanagi?

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:16.250
You're quitting the
Kao Council because of that...?

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:21.370
I never forgot your promise
from that day. I kept on believing in it.

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:25.200
No matter where we are,
we can still play together.

00:17:28.950 --> 00:17:31.120
I am me.

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:36.330
It doesn't matter if we're Otori or Hiragi.
Let's play together again...

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:41.410
Tsubasa.

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.540
Big Brother Itsuki...

00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:22.040
♪ Ever since that day, I've been waiting ♪

00:18:22.040 --> 00:18:30.000
♪ In this dull and colorless world ♪

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:37.950
♪ Ever since that day, I've believed ♪

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:44.950
♪ That we would meet again
on the promised day ♪

00:18:44.950 --> 00:18:48.790
♪ There are no rules in dreams! ♪

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:52.910
♪ I can't do selfish things! ♪

00:18:52.910 --> 00:18:59.580
♪ The futures we imagine do not cross ♪

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:02.540
♪ They're one way roads ♪

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:06.450
♪ You were by my side more than anyone else ♪

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:11.080
♪ If we follow those kind memories ♪

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:14.830
♪ The dream we were aiming for ♪

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:18.910
♪ Should have brought us to the same place ♪

00:19:18.910 --> 00:19:22.500
♪ Chasing after you, seeing you off ♪

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:27.000
♪ Being knocked around by the winds of fate ♪

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:28.750
♪ We are... ♪

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:30.700
♪ We are... ♪

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:38.000
♪ ...separated again with our backs to each other ♪

00:19:46.750 --> 00:19:48.370
What are you doing?

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:50.830
Otori, sir!

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:53.950
That wasn't the choreography from
"Stardust Musical" just now, was it?

00:19:53.950 --> 00:19:55.500
You could tell?

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:59.290
I come here and do this
dance when I get stuck...

00:19:59.290 --> 00:20:02.200
You danced that at the department
entrance test, too, didn't you?

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:05.160
That's right! Actually, it was this dance is...

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:13.120
Oh? You have a high schooler you admire, huh?

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:16.330
I thought I could meet him once school started,

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:19.040
but I don't really remember his face...

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:20.330
But that's fine.

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:23.950
As long as I dance this dance,
I feel like I'll be able to meet him one day!

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:27.330
That's just like you, Hoshitani.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:30.040
Oh, I'm not making fun of you.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.620
It's just a little embarrassing...

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:38.080
I want someone to be as absorbed
in my dancing as I was in his.

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:40.120
Is that weird?

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:42.580
It's the best.

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:49.370
But I think there's still a part
of that dance that isn't perfect.

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:52.580
That high schooler was
probably still practicing, too.

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:54.160
Huh?

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:55.250
Try getting into position.

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:56.910
Yes, sir!

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:04.660
Think about the position of your arms,

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:06.660
and put your hips into it
as you get ready to turn.

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:22.580
Even though it's the same dance...

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:24.950
It feels totally different...

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:29.790
That's right. This dance doesn't
need you to use extra effort.

00:21:29.790 --> 00:21:35.290
Sir! Besides the high schooler
I admire, I also respect you, sir!

00:21:35.290 --> 00:21:36.290
Huh?

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:38.000
Otori, sir, you're strange,
but your practices are interesting,

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:40.000
and you think of fun things for us to do.

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:42.950
I'm really glad I could be in Team Otori!

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:53.580
Oh no! It's my turn to clean
the dorm, so please excuse me!

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:55.000
I see.

00:21:56.200 --> 00:21:58.290
Let's work hard for the Ayanagi Festival!

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:09.160
Tsubasa...

00:22:09.160 --> 00:22:15.040
I want those boys to come
to like the taste of orange juice...

00:22:30.660 --> 00:22:37.830
<i>Someday, when you're crushed by your dreams</i>

00:22:37.830 --> 00:22:44.330
<i>On a night when you look up at a starless sky</i>

00:22:44.330 --> 00:22:47.830
<i>Just remember (today)</i>

00:22:47.830 --> 00:22:52.120
<i>The days we ran like crazy (together)</i>

00:22:52.120 --> 00:22:56.250
<i>Those steps were miracles</i>

00:22:56.250 --> 00:22:59.500
<i>Ring out, Countdown!</i>

00:22:59.500 --> 00:23:03.080
<i>Taking off for the future from here</i>

00:23:03.080 --> 00:23:07.080
<i>You will start singing again</i>

00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:10.250
<i>There are things you lack</i>

00:23:10.250 --> 00:23:14.120
<i>So you reach out desperately to grab them</i>

00:23:14.120 --> 00:23:17.620
<i>These hot, passionate feelings overflowing</i>

00:23:17.620 --> 00:23:21.370
<i>Make the light of the stars your ally</i>

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:24.910
<i>Even bluffing can become your pride</i>

00:23:24.910 --> 00:23:28.580
<i>You can fly however you want</i>

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:34.580
<i>Everything starts now!</i>

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:55.950
"Notice: Because of Itsuki Otori's withdrawal from the Kao Council,
Team Otori has been demoted to a regular team."

00:23:56.290 --> 00:24:10.830
"Act 10"

00:23:56.870 --> 00:23:59.160
Akatsuki, I am always grateful to you.

00:23:59.160 --> 00:24:00.080
Hiragi!

00:24:00.080 --> 00:24:02.370
However, sometimes you let
your emotions get the best of you.

00:24:02.370 --> 00:24:03.250
Hiragi...

00:24:03.250 --> 00:24:05.790
I have high hopes for you.
Let's work hard and grow together.

00:24:05.790 --> 00:24:06.790
Hiragi!

00:24:06.790 --> 00:24:09.660
Now if you will excuse me,
I promised Otori I'd have a meal with him.

00:24:09.660 --> 00:24:10.830
Hiragi!

00:24:11.080 --> 00:24:20.750
"We'll hold you close
next week, too. Right, Ugawa?"
